PHASE E — THE CEILING, stated as what it is: an IDENTITY of the criterion, not a result.
   rig3 criteria() honest requires scored.above > 0.095 m at the scored instant. above is
   trunk z minus the tread height, and maxZ is the trunk's maximum over the whole episode,
   so honest in a cell IMPLIES maxZ - rise > 0.095 in that cell. Therefore
   kCore <= ceilingCore, for every landing law that exists or could be written.
